==1978 FIFA World Cup==
===Qualification for Group B===
====Argentina====
{{main|1978 FIFA World Cup Group 1}}

Argentina qualified second in their group after beating [[Hungary national football team|Hungary]] and [[France national football team|France]] by 2–1 goal margin. By the time of the third game, Argentina was already qualified together with [[Italy national football team|Italy]]. The last game of the group was Italy-Argentina, which ended in a 1–0 victory for the Italians.

